{"id": "68836", "title": "异世迷情：傲娇小爷笨跟班", "author": "晓耗子", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 50, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/68/68836.htm", "intro": "糖豆，十七岁，初中毕业在鞋厂上班。外面租了个房子，巧合遇上林平之的魂魄，雷电交加的雨夜，不幸被闪电击中，到了古代，还算幸运的是，又遇上了小林子一枚，只是他忘却了现代生活的几天，糖豆要帮他找回记忆，当然，还想改变一下历史特定结局。她要嫁给他，她不要他娶灵珊，也不要他自宫，亦不要他瞎眼，更不要他在西湖底过那暗无天日的生活。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68836", "chapters": [{"title": "1.夜深人静 午夜梦回", "file": "10548345.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2.狼牙玉", "file": "10548346.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3.平安符", "file": "10548347.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4.受伤的小兽", "file": "10548348.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5.在下林平之", "file": "10548349.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6.这是什么鬼地方", "file": "10548350.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7.老天不公", "file": "10548351.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8.灭门", "file": "10548352.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9.你说的是真的", "file": "10548353.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10.温水如玉", "file": "10548354.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11.最男人不过林平之", "file": "10548355.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12.辟邪之物", "file": "10548356.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13.美男我来啦", "file": "10548357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14.试试看你能吃不", "file": "10548358.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15.同苦不共甘", "file": "10548359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16.不怕不怕", "file": "10548360.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17.只是什么是厕所啊", "file": "10548361.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18.美妙的一吻", "file": "10548362.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19.良心老板", "file": "10548363.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20.怨气太重 阎王不收", "file": "10548364.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21.你生气了", "file": "10548365.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22.眼波流转", "file": "10548366.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23.人鬼情未了", "file": "10548367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24.电闪雷鸣", "file": "105